Hello,

This is the first update after full release. 
It fixes a few minor bugs and adds a visual option (thanks to user feedback).

Here is the changelog:
  - Added option to soft background colors;
  - You can also press B key during a puzzle to change the background color;
  - Fixed Steam Screenshots issues;
  - A few visual bug fixes on some hints;
  - Notation bug fixes;

Thanks a lot.

Eduardo

Hi,

I’m happy to announce that version 1.0 is finally live. The game was updated accordingly.
As I said before, not a lot of changes here, mostly bug fixes.

Please find below the changelog to the updates made between the last announcement (October 13th) and version 1.0:
  - 3 new levels added (levels E-N-D if the player has the necessary stars);
  - Corrected a few ambient effects and sound bugs;
  - Level 62 group sums and hints fixed;
  - 3 new achievements added (for completing levels E-N-D);
  - Small changes in (tutorial) text to make it more clear;
  - Performance tweaks;
  - Other small bug fixes;

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/33140319/5d7b29f0ed6a0c144bb1c76e53113ed40d379df6.gif[/img]


Thank you very much for all the feedback and support.

Eduardo

Hi,

Version 1.0 will (finally) be released in the beginning of next month. 
Meanwhile the game has just been updated, so those that already have it can enjoy the puzzles and features of the final game. The major difference will be bugfixes.

Changelog:

  - A few changes in the visual department (a bit more polished now);
  - 12 new levels were added;
  - New ambient effect;
  - It’s now possible to earn 2 stars in each level: one for not using hints and other for not making mistakes;
  - New achievements added;
  - Grey note added (press SPACE while dragging the note to change it);
  - A lot of small bugfixes;

Thank you very much for all support, help and patience. 

Regards,
Eduardo

